{"id":"5260a5349d0b732f","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Product Topology","display":"df-zfc-top5-product-topology — ZFC Top5 Product Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology","58-df-zfc-top2-product-topology","58-df-zfc-top6-product-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-product-topology — ZFC Top5 Product Topology","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</span><span>58-df-zfc-top2-product-topology</span><span>58-df-zfc-top6-product-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-product-topology — ZFC Top5 Product Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" href=\"?note=3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier\">58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage\">58-df-zfc-rel-preimage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a78929818a246ba\" href=\"?note=3a78929818a246ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cf21178fae2ba8e\" href=\"?note=9cf21178fae2ba8e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\land X=\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec X(i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec\\tau(i))\\land\\tau=\\left\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid \\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists F\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists u\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(u,F,\\bigcup_{i\\in F}\\vec\\tau(i)\\right)\\land\\forall i\\in F\\;(u(i)\\in\\vec\\tau(i)\\land x(i)\\in u(i))\\land\\{y\\in X\\mid\\forall i\\in F\\;y(i)\\in u(i)\\}\\subseteq U\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\land X=\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec X(i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec\\tau(i))\\land\\tau=\\left\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid \\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists F\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists u\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(u,F,\\bigcup_{i\\in F}\\vec\\tau(i)\\right)\\land\\forall i\\in F\\;(u(i)\\in\\vec\\tau(i)\\land x(i)\\in u(i))\\land\\{y\\in X\\mid\\forall i\\in F\\;y(i)\\in u(i)\\}\\subseteq U\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Product topology is generated by finite-coordinate cylinder sets.</li>\n<li>The aliases in frontmatter are retained for legacy references to the same product-topology atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier","status":"resolved","id":"3dc4b831bf6ebd98","anchor